      "content": "Trade Views now returns Option summaries for Planned, Open, and Closed trades, but TradeList and TradeDetail pass those summaries directly to this formatter without an option guard. Consequently, displaying any option trade throws during rendering instead of showing its contract label; tradeName and review cards can fail as well. Format the option direction, contract quantity, expiration, strike, and right here rather than throwing.",
