    {
      "path": "src/coordinators/trade-views/trade-views.ts",
      "content": "`closedItem` now returns Option Disposition Timing at runtime, but `ClosedTradeItem` has no `optionDispositionTiming` member (it was added only to `ClosedTradeDetail`). Consequently, callers of the typed `browseTrades({ lifecycle: 'Closed' })` API cannot access the required timing or its two quantities without a cast. Add the optional member to `ClosedTradeItem` as well, and exclude it from `IncoherentClosedTradeItem` if it is unavailable without a replay.",
